<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Project Charter – International Data Science Conference</title>
  <style>
    /* ── Reset & Base ── */
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    :root {
      --primary:       #1a3a5c;
      --primary-light: #2563a8;
      --accent:        #0ea5e9;
      --accent-soft:   #e0f2fe;
      --success:       #16a34a;
      --warning:       #d97706;
      --danger:        #dc2626;
      --neutral-50:    #f8fafc;
      --neutral-100:   #f1f5f9;
      --neutral-200:   #e2e8f0;
      --neutral-300:   #cbd5e1;
      --neutral-600:   #475569;
      --neutral-700:   #334155;
      --neutral-800:   #1e293b;
      --neutral-900:   #0f172a;
      --font-sans:     'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
      --font-mono:     'Cascadia Code', 'Fira Code', monospace;
      --radius:        8px;
      --shadow-sm:     0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.08), 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.06);
      --shadow-md:     0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.10), 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.06);
      --shadow-lg:     0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.12), 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.06);
    }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: var(--neutral-800);
      background: var(--neutral-100);
    }

    /* ── Page Wrapper ── */
    .page {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: #fff;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
    }

    /* ── Cover Header ── */
    .cover {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary) 0%, var(--primary-light) 60%, var(--accent) 100%);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 64px 56px 48px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .cover::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: -80px; right: -80px;
      width: 320px; height: 320px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.06);
    }

    .cover::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -60px; left: -60px;
      width: 240px; height: 240px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.04);
    }

    .cover-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.18);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.30);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 4px 16px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: .08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .cover h1 {
      font-size: 2.6rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      letter-spacing: -.02em;
    }

    .cover-sub {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      opacity: .85;
      margin-bottom: 36px;
      max-width: 600px;
    }

    .cover-meta {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .cover-meta-item {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 2px;
    }

    .cover-meta-label {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: .1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      opacity: .65;
    }

    .cover-meta-value {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    /* ── Table of Contents ── */
    .toc {
      background: var(--neutral-50);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--neutral-200);
      padding: 32px 56px;
    }

    .toc h2 {
      font-size: .75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: .12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--neutral-600);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .toc-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 8px 24px;
    }

    .toc-grid a {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      color: var(--primary-light);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 13.5px;
      font-weight: 500;
      padding: 4px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--neutral-200);
      transition: color .2s;
    }

    .toc-grid a:hover { color: var(--accent); }

    .toc-num {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--neutral-300);
      min-width: 22px;
    }

    /* ── Main Content ── */
    .content {
      padding: 48px 56px 64px;
    }

    /* ── Section ── */
    .section {
      margin-bottom: 56px;
    }

    .section-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      padding-bottom: 12px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--neutral-200);
    }

    .section-number {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      width: 36px; height: 36px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--primary);
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 800;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--primary);
      letter-spacing: -.01em;
    }

    /* ── Sub-section ── */
    .subsection {
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .subsection-title {
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--neutral-700);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .subsection-title::before {
      content: '';
      display: inline-block;
      width: 4px; height: 16px;
      background: var(--accent);
      border-radius: 2px;
    }

    /* ── Prose ── */
    p { margin-bottom: 12px; color: var(--neutral-700); }
    p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

    /* ── Lists ── */
    ul, ol {
      padding-left: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      color: var(--neutral-700);
    }

    li { margin-bottom: 6px; }

    li strong { color: var(--neutral-800); }

    /* ── Objective Cards ── */
    .objective-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .objective-card {
      border: 1px solid var(--neutral-200);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 20px;
      background: var(--neutral-50);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: box-shadow .2s;
    }

    .objective-card:hover { box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }

    .objective-card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0; left: 0;
      width: 4px; height: 100%;
      background: var(--primary-light);
    }

    .objective-card-num {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: .1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--primary-light);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .objective-card-title {
      font-size: .95rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--neutral-800);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .objective-card p {
      font-size: .875rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 0;
    }

    /* ── Info Boxes ── */
    .info-box {
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 16px 20px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .info-box-icon {
      font-size: 18px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      margin-top: 1px;
    }

    .info-box-body { flex: 1; }
    .info-box-body strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: .9rem; }
    .info-box-body p { font-size: .875rem; margin: 0; }

    .info-box.blue   { background: #eff6ff; border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6; }
    .info-box.green  { background: #f0fdf4; border-left: 4px solid #22c55e; }
    .info-box.amber  { background: #fffbeb; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; }
    .info-box.red    { background: #fef2f2; border-left: 4px solid #ef4444; }

    /* ── Tables ── */
    .table-wrap {
      overflow-x: auto;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-size: 13.5px;
    }

    thead tr {
      background: var(--primary);
      color: #fff;
    }

    thead th {
      padding: 12px 16px;
      text-align: left;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: .05em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    tbody tr { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--neutral-200); }
    tbody tr:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    tbody tr:nth-child(even) { background: var(--neutral-50); }
    tbody tr:hover { background: var(--accent-soft); }

    tbody td {
      padding: 11px 16px;
      color: var(--neutral-700);
      vertical-align: top;
    }

    tbody td:first-child { font-weight: 600; color: var(--neutral-800); }

    /* ── Budget Bars ── */
    .budget-bar-wrap { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }

    .budget-bar {
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      background: var(--primary-light);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .budget-pct { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary-light); }

    /* ── Risk Badges ── */
    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 2px 10px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .05em;
    }

    .badge-high     { background: #fee2e2; color: #b91c1c; }
    .badge-medium   { background: #fef3c7; color: #92400e; }
    .badge-low      { background: #dcfce7; color: #166534; }
    .badge-critical { background: #fce7f3; color: #9d174d; }

    /* ── RACI ── */
    .raci-r { background: #dbeafe; color: #1d4ed8; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; padding: 2px 8px; font-size: 12px; }
    .raci-a { background: #fce7f3; color: #9d174d; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; padding: 2px 8px; font-size: 12px; }
    .raci-ar { background: linear-gradient(90deg,#fce7f3,#dbeafe); color: #1e3a5f; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; padding: 2px 8px; font-size: 12px; }
    .raci-c { background: #f0fdf4; color: #166534; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; padding: 2px 8px; font-size: 12px; }
    .raci-i { background: var(--neutral-100); color: var(--neutral-600); font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; padding: 2px 8px; font-size: 12px; }

    /* ── WBS ── */
    .wbs-section { margin-bottom: 20px; }

    .wbs-level1 {
      background: var(--primary);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 10px 16px;
      border-radius: var(--radius) var(--radius) 0 0;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: .9rem;
    }

    .wbs-level2 {
      background: var(--accent-soft);
      border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
      padding: 8px 16px 8px 24px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: .875rem;
      color: var(--primary);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--neutral-200);
    }

    .wbs-level3 {
      padding: 6px 16px 6px 40px;
      font-size: .85rem;
      color: var(--neutral-700);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--neutral-100);
      border-left: 3px solid var(--neutral-200);
    }

    .wbs-level3:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

    .wbs-body {
      border: 1px solid var(--neutral-200);
      border-top: none;
      border-radius: 0 0 var(--radius) var(--radius);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    /* ── Governance Cards ── */
    .gov-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .gov-card {
      border: 1px solid var(--neutral-200);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 18px;
      background: var(--neutral-50);
    }

    .gov-card-label {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: .1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--neutral-600);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .gov-card-name {
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--primary);
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .gov-card-role {
      font-size: .8rem;
      color: var(--neutral-600);
    }

    /* ── Escalation Steps ── */
    .escalation {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0;
      position: relative;
    }

    .escalation::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      left: 18px; top: 36px; bottom: 36px;
      width: 2px;
      background: var(--neutral-200);
    }

    .escalation-step {
      display: flex;
      gap: 16px;
      align-items: flex-start;
      padding: 12px 0;
    }

    .escalation-dot {
      width: 36px; height: 36px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--primary);
      color: #fff;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 13px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .escalation-body strong { display: block; font-size: .9rem; color: var(--neutral-800); }
    .escalation-body p { font-size: .85rem; color: var(--neutral-600); margin: 0; }

    /* ── Signature Table ── */
    .sig-table td { padding: 14px 16px; }
    .sig-line {
      display: block;
      width: 160px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--neutral-400);
      height: 28px;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    /* ── Footer ── */
    .doc-footer {
      background: var(--primary);
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.7);
      padding: 20px 56px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .doc-footer strong { color: #fff; }

    /* ── Print ── */
    @media print {
      body { background: #fff; }
      .page { box-shadow: none; max-width: 100%; }
      .cover { -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; print-color-adjust: exact; }
    }

    /* ── Responsive ── */
    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      .cover, .toc, .content { padding-left: 24px; padding-right: 24px; }
      .cover h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
      .objective-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .gov-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
       COVER
  ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <header class="cover">
    <div class="cover-badge">Project Charter · Version 1.0</div>
    <h1>International Data Science Conference</h1>
    <p class="cover-sub">
      A strategic initiative to foster networking, skill development, and career
      opportunities for the university community at Campus Guadalajara.
    </p>
    <div class="cover-meta">
      <div class="cover-meta-item">
        <span class="cover-meta-label">Event Date</span>
        <span class="cover-meta-value">March 22, 2027</span>
      </div>
      <div class="cover-meta-item">
        <span class="cover-meta-label">Project Manager</span>
        <span class="cover-meta-value">Aníbal González Urteaga</span>
      </div>
      <div class="cover-meta-item">
        <span class="cover-meta-label">Sponsor</span>
        <span class="cover-meta-value">Campus Guadalajara Administration</span>
      </div>
      <div class="cover-meta-item">
        <span class="cover-meta-label">Category</span>
        <span class="cover-meta-value">Technology / IT</span>
      </div>
      <div class="cover-meta-item">
        <span class="cover-meta-label">Venue Capacity</span>
        <span class="cover-meta-value">500 Attendees</span>
      </div>
      <div class="cover-meta-item">
        <span class="cover-meta-label">Reimbursement Deadline</span>
        <span class="cover-meta-value">March 29, 2027</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
       TABLE OF CONTENTS
  ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <nav class="toc">
    <h2>Table of Contents</h2>
    <div class="toc-grid">
      <a href="#s1"><span class="toc-num">1.0</span> Background</a>
      <a href="#s2"><span class="toc-num">2.0</span> Scope</a>
      <a href="#s3"><span class="toc-num">3.0</span> Objectives</a>
      <a href="#s4"><span class="toc-num">4.0</span> Governance</a>
      <a href="#s5"><span class="toc-num">5.0</span> Budget</a>
      <a href="#s6"><span class="toc-num">6.0</span> Assumptions, Constraints &amp; Dependencies</a>
      <a href="#s7"><span class="toc-num">7.0</span> Work Breakdown Structure</a>
      <a href="#s8"><span class="toc-num">8.0</span> Responsibility Matrix (RACI)</a>
      <a href="#s9"><span class="toc-num">9.0</span> Approval Signatures</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
       MAIN CONTENT
  ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <main class="content">

    <!-- ── 1. Background ── -->
    <section class="section" id="s1">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-number">1</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Background</h2>
      </div>
      <p>
        The International Data Science Conference is a strategic initiative designed to foster
        networking, skill development, and career opportunities for the university community.
        Scheduled for <strong>March 22, 2027</strong>, this Technology/IT project addresses the
        growing demand for practical Data Science education and industry connections among
        undergraduate students, postgraduate students, and the broader university public at
        <strong>Campus Guadalajara</strong>.
      </p>
      <p>
        The conference serves as a platform to bridge academic learning with industry practice by
        connecting students with leading companies in the Data Science field. Through hands-on
        workshops, networking sessions, and recruitment opportunities, the event aims to enhance
        participants' technical competencies while providing direct access to career pathways.
        The project aligns with the university's strategic goals of industry engagement, student
        employability, and academic excellence in emerging technology fields.
      </p>
      <div class="info-box blue">
        <span class="info-box-icon">💡</span>
        <div class="info-box-body">
          <strong>Financial Mandate</strong>
          <p>
            Campus Guadalajara has authorized this initiative with the requirement that all
            allocated funds be fully reimbursed within one week following the conference through
            a combination of ticket sales, corporate sponsorships, and other revenue streams.
            This self-sustaining financial model demonstrates fiscal responsibility while
            maximizing accessibility and impact for the university community.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── 2. Scope ── -->
    <section class="section" id="s2">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-number">2</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Scope</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="subsection">
        <h3 class="subsection-title">2.1 In Scope</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Venue Selection &amp; Management:</strong> Identification and booking of a 500-capacity venue based on target audience accessibility, cost-effectiveness, and facility requirements (AV equipment, breakout rooms, networking spaces).</li>
          <li><strong>Marketing &amp; Promotion:</strong> Comprehensive advertisement campaign including digital marketing, campus outreach, email campaigns, and social media promotion to drive registration.</li>
          <li><strong>Corporate Partnership Program:</strong> Outreach to and coordination of at least five recognized companies (Fortune 1000, major tech firms, or established Data Science employers) to provide on-site recruitment booths and networking participation.</li>
          <li><strong>Learning Activities:</strong> Design and delivery of three distinct 90-minute hands-on Data Science workshops (Machine Learning Basics, Data Visualization, Python for Data Analysis) with materials and facilitator coordination.</li>
          <li><strong>Financial Management:</strong> Budget development, revenue generation through ticket sales and sponsorships, expense tracking, and complete fund reimbursement within seven days post-event.</li>
          <li><strong>Event Logistics:</strong> Registration system, attendee management, day-of-event coordination, basic refreshments, and technical support.</li>
          <li><strong>Reporting &amp; Documentation:</strong> Attendance estimation within three weeks of project start, final comprehensive report to Campus Guadalajara including financial reconciliation and recommendations.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="subsection">
        <h3 class="subsection-title">2.2 Out of Scope</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Post-event community building, ongoing Data Science programs, or alumni networks.</li>
          <li>Recording, editing, post-production, or distribution of conference content.</li>
          <li>Full catering services beyond basic refreshments (coffee, light snacks).</li>
          <li>Transportation, accommodation, or travel arrangements for attendees or speakers.</li>
          <li>Follow-up job placement services, recruitment tracking, or career counseling.</li>
          <li>Merchandise production or sales.</li>
          <li>Multi-day or satellite events beyond the March 22, 2027 conference date.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── 3. Objectives ── -->
    <section class="section" id="s3">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-number">3</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Objectives</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="objective-grid">

        <div class="objective-card">
          <div class="objective-card-num">Objective 1</div>
          <div class="objective-card-title">Attendance Target</div>
          <p>Achieve confirmed registration of at least <strong>300 attendees</strong> (60% of 500-capacity venue) by March 15, 2027. Minimum demographic distribution: 40% undergraduate, 30% postgraduate, 30% general university public.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="objective-card">
          <div class="objective-card-num">Objective 2</div>
          <div class="objective-card-title">Attendance Forecasting</div>
          <p>Complete and submit a data-driven attendance forecast with <strong>±15% accuracy margin</strong> by project start + 3 weeks, based on ≥200 survey responses, historical data, and venue capacity analysis. Approved by Campus Guadalajara.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="objective-card">
          <div class="objective-card-num">Objective 3</div>
          <div class="objective-card-title">Corporate Participation</div>
          <p>Secure written commitments from at least <strong>five recognized companies</strong> (Fortune 1000, major tech firms, or established Data Science employers) to provide on-site recruitment booths by <strong>February 15, 2027</strong>.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="objective-card">
          <div class="objective-card-num">Objective 4</div>
          <div class="objective-card-title">Learning Activities</div>
          <p>Design, promote, and deliver <strong>three distinct 90-minute workshops</strong> with minimum 25 participants each on March 22, 2027. Post-session satisfaction ratings averaging <strong>4.0/5.0 or higher</strong>.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="objective-card">
          <div class="objective-card-num">Objective 5</div>
          <div class="objective-card-title">Financial Accountability</div>
          <p>Submit a comprehensive final report to Campus Guadalajara by <strong>March 29, 2027</strong> including detailed budget, 100% fund reimbursement documentation, attendance analytics, company outcomes, and future recommendations.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── 4. Governance ── -->
    <section class="section" id="s4">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-number">4</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Governance</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="subsection">
        <h3 class="subsection-title">4.1 Authority Structure</h3>
        <div class="gov-grid">
          <div class="gov-card">
            <div class="gov-card-label">Project Sponsor</div>
            <div class="gov-card-name">Campus Guadalajara Administration</div>
            <div class="gov-card-role">Budget approval, major scope changes, final report acceptance</div>
          </div>
          <div class="gov-card">
            <div class="gov-card-label">Project Manager</div>
            <div class="gov-card-name">Aníbal González Urteaga</div>
            <div class="gov-card-role">Overall project coordination, final reporting, investment strategy</div>
          </div>
          <div class="gov-card">
            <div class="gov-card-label">Steering Committee</div>
            <div class="gov-card-name">Campus Guadalajara Governance Board</div>
            <div class="gov-card-role">Budget approval, major scope changes, final report acceptance</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="subsection">
        <h3 class="subsection-title">4.2 Decision-Making Authority</h3>
        <div class="table-wrap">
          <table>
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Decision Area</th>
                <th>Authority</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td>Budget allocations up to 10% variance</td><td>Project Manager</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Budget changes exceeding 10%</td><td>Steering Committee approval required</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Venue selection</td><td>Project Manager with Steering Committee consultation</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Corporate partnership agreements</td><td>Luimanol Rivas Torres with Project Manager approval</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Marketing strategy and materials</td><td>Ian Ricardo Villarreal Rios with Project Manager consultation</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Workshop content and facilitators</td><td>Andrés Crisostomo Gómez with Project Manager approval</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="subsection">
        <h3 class="subsection-title">4.3 Reporting &amp; Communication</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Weekly status meetings:</strong> All team members, chaired by Project Manager.</li>
          <li><strong>Bi-weekly progress reports:</strong> Project Manager to Steering Committee.</li>
          <li><strong>Milestone reviews:</strong> Formal review at attendance estimation completion, corporate commitments secured, and two weeks pre-event.</li>
          <li><strong>Final report:</strong> Comprehensive documentation submitted March 29, 2027.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="subsection">
        <h3 class="subsection-title">4.4 Escalation Procedures</h3>
        <div class="escalation">
