              <p>Issues resolved within team within 48 hours.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="escalation-step">
            <div class="escalation-dot">2</div>
            <div class="escalation-body">
              <strong>Level 2 – Project Manager</strong>
              <p>Unresolved issues escalated to Project Manager for resolution within 5 business days.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="escalation-step">
            <div class="escalation-dot">3</div>
            <div class="escalation-body">
              <strong>Level 3 – Steering Committee</strong>
              <p>Critical issues affecting budget, timeline, or objectives escalated to Steering Committee for immediate resolution.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="subsection">
        <h3 class="subsection-title">4.5 Change Control</h3>
        <div class="info-box amber">
          <span class="info-box-icon">⚠️</span>
          <div class="info-box-body">
            <strong>Change Request Process</strong>
            <p>All scope, budget, or timeline changes require a written change request submitted to the Project Manager, impact analysis completed within 3 business days, and Steering Committee approval for changes affecting core objectives or budget exceeding 10%.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── 5. Budget ── -->
    <section class="section" id="s5">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-number">5</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Budget</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="subsection">
        <h3 class="subsection-title">5.1 Budget Framework</h3>
        <p>Campus Guadalajara provides initial investment with mandatory <strong>100% reimbursement within one week post-event</strong> (by March 29, 2027). Final budget allocation subject to Steering Committee approval based on attendance forecast and revenue projections.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="subsection">
        <h3 class="subsection-title">5.2 Estimated Budget Allocation</h3>
        <div class="table-wrap">
          <table>
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Category</th>
                <th>Estimated Allocation</th>
                <th>Visual</th>
                <th>Revenue Source</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td>Venue Rental</td>
                <td>30%</td>
                <td><div class="budget-bar-wrap"><div class="budget-bar" style="width:90px"></div><span class="budget-pct">30%</span></div></td>
                <td>Ticket Sales (60%)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Marketing &amp; Advertising</td>
                <td>25%</td>
                <td><div class="budget-bar-wrap"><div class="budget-bar" style="width:75px"></div><span class="budget-pct">25%</span></div></td>
                <td>Corporate Sponsorships (35%)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Workshop Materials &amp; Facilitators</td>
                <td>20%</td>
                <td><div class="budget-bar-wrap"><div class="budget-bar" style="width:60px"></div><span class="budget-pct">20%</span></div></td>
                <td>University Subsidy (5%)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Technology &amp; Registration Systems</td>
                <td>10%</td>
                <td><div class="budget-bar-wrap"><div class="budget-bar" style="width:30px"></div><span class="budget-pct">10%</span></div></td>
                <td>—</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Event Day Operations</td>
                <td>10%</td>
                <td><div class="budget-bar-wrap"><div class="budget-bar" style="width:30px"></div><span class="budget-pct">10%</span></div></td>
                <td>—</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Contingency Reserve</td>
                <td>5%</td>
                <td><div class="budget-bar-wrap"><div class="budget-bar" style="width:15px; background:#94a3b8"></div><span class="budget-pct" style="color:#94a3b8">5%</span></div></td>
                <td>—</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="subsection">
        <h3 class="subsection-title">5.3 Revenue Model</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Ticket Sales:</strong> Tiered pricing structure (student rate, general admission) targeting 300 attendees.</li>
          <li><strong>Corporate Sponsorship Packages:</strong> Three-tier system (Platinum, Gold, Silver) offering booth space, branding, and networking access.</li>
          <li><strong>University Support:</strong> Limited subsidy for educational components aligned with institutional priorities.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="subsection">
        <h3 class="subsection-title">5.4 Financial Controls</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Monthly budget reviews with variance analysis.</li>
          <li>All expenditures require dual authorization (budget holder + Project Manager).</li>
          <li>Revenue tracking dashboard updated weekly.</li>
          <li>Payment processing arrangements to ensure funds available by March 29, 2027 deadline.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── 6. Assumptions, Constraints & Dependencies ── -->
    <section class="section" id="s6">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-number">6</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Assumptions, Constraints &amp; Dependencies</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="subsection">
        <h3 class="subsection-title">6.1 Assumptions</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>University corporate partnership agreements provide direct access to at least 10 potential company partners.</li>
          <li>Target audience has demonstrated interest in Data Science topics based on enrollment trends and previous event attendance.</li>
          <li>Campus Guadalajara will provide administrative support for contract processing and vendor management.</li>
          <li>Registration system and payment processing infrastructure available through university IT services.</li>
          <li>Workshop facilitators available from faculty, industry partners, or graduate student pool.</li>
          <li>March 22, 2027 date does not conflict with major academic calendar events (exams, holidays, competing conferences).</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="subsection">
        <h3 class="subsection-title">6.2 Constraints</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Timeline:</strong> Fixed event date of March 22, 2027; three-week deadline for attendance estimation; one-week post-event reimbursement deadline.</li>
          <li><strong>Financial:</strong> 100% fund reimbursement requirement; no deficit financing permitted.</li>
          <li><strong>Resource:</strong> Team members balancing project responsibilities with academic or professional commitments.</li>
          <li><strong>Venue:</strong> Limited availability of suitable 500-capacity venues within budget parameters.</li>
          <li><strong>Authority:</strong> Team requires university approval for corporate agreements and vendor contracts.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="subsection">
        <h3 class="subsection-title">6.3 Dependencies</h3>
        <div class="info-box blue">
          <span class="info-box-icon">🔗</span>
          <div class="info-box-body">
            <strong>Critical Path Dependencies</strong>
            <p>Attendance estimation → Venue finalization → Marketing campaign launch → Corporate commitments → Sponsorship revenue projections → Workshop facilitator confirmation (6 weeks before event) → Registration system operational (8 weeks before event).</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="info-box amber">
          <span class="info-box-icon">🌐</span>
          <div class="info-box-body">
            <strong>External Dependencies</strong>
            <p>University approval processes for venue booking and budget allocation; corporate partner decision timelines and contract execution; vendor availability (AV equipment, catering, printing services); payment processing timelines for ticket sales and sponsorship payments.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="subsection">
        <h3 class="subsection-title">6.4 Risk Register</h3>
        <div class="table-wrap">
          <table>
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Risk</th>
                <th>Impact</th>
                <th>Likelihood</th>
                <th>Mitigation Strategy</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td>Low attendance (&lt;60%)</td>
                <td><span class="badge badge-high">High</span></td>
                <td><span class="badge badge-medium">Medium</span></td>
                <td>Tiered marketing with escalation triggers; early-bird incentives; faculty endorsements.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Reimbursement deadline not met</td>
                <td><span class="badge badge-critical">Critical</span></td>
                <td><span class="badge badge-medium">Medium</span></td>
                <td>Negotiate 30-day extension; secure bridge funding; accelerate payment processing.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Insufficient corporate participation</td>
                <td><span class="badge badge-high">High</span></td>
                <td><span class="badge badge-low">Low</span></td>
                <td>Leverage university agreements early; expand outreach beyond initial target list.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Venue unavailable / unaffordable</td>
                <td><span class="badge badge-high">High</span></td>
                <td><span class="badge badge-medium">Medium</span></td>
                <td>Identify 3 backup venues; begin venue search immediately upon project start.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Workshop facilitator cancellations</td>
                <td><span class="badge badge-medium">Medium</span></td>
                <td><span class="badge badge-low">Low</span></td>
                <td>Secure backup facilitators; develop contingency content.</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

